277
00:10:39,413 --> 00:10:40,776
It’s so cute.

278
00:10:41,137 --> 00:10:43,500
P’Chan loves Key.

279
00:10:44,266 --> 00:10:45,500
Forever.

280
00:10:45,866 --> 00:10:48,311
