281
00:10:49,047 --> 00:10:51,988
It’s a lovely day, more than I expected.

282
00:10:52,059 --> 00:10:53,300
It’s like a vacation for us.

283
00:10:53,330 --> 00:10:55,120
Yes, it feels like a vacation.

284
