that Gen Z likes to do?

296
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:32,011
-Yes, cake decorating.
-I have never done it before.

297
00:11:32,054 --> 00:11:33,604
I have never done it.

298
00:11:34,272 --> 00:11:36,601
Thank you so much, GMMTV.

299
00:11:36,825 --> 00:11:38,281
